sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as B2B / Retail Customer
    participant Client as React 19 Client UI
    participant AcceptJS as Authorize.Net Accept.js
    participant ServerAction as Next.js Server Action / API
    participant Prisma as Prisma Accelerate + AWS RDS
    participant AuthNet as Authorize.Net Gateway
    participant ForeverPOS as ForeverPOS API (Back-Office)

    Customer->>Client: Submit Card Details (PAN, CVV, Exp)
    Client->>AcceptJS: dispatchData(secureData)
    AcceptJS-->>Client: opaqueData (nonce: tokenValue)
    Note over Client,AcceptJS: PCI-DSS Zero-Card-Data Exposure on Server

    Client->>ServerAction: POST /api/checkout (opaqueData, cartItems, billing)
    ServerAction->>Prisma: Begin Transaction: Validate & Lock Stock
    Prisma-->>ServerAction: Current Stock Validated
    ServerAction->>ServerAction: Calculate Order Total & VAT (Decimals)

    ServerAction->>AuthNet: Phase 1: createTransactionRequest (AUTH_ONLY)
    alt Gateway Declined / Network Failure
        AuthNet-->>ServerAction: 400 Error (Declined / Error Code)
        ServerAction->>Prisma: Rollback Local Transaction & Release Locks
        ServerAction-->>Client: Payment Failed Error Message
    else Authorization Approved (transId granted)
        AuthNet-->>ServerAction: 200 OK: transId, authCode
        ServerAction->>Prisma: Insert Order (status='pending_settlement', transId)
        ServerAction->>Prisma: Insert OrderItems (Variant Snapshots)
        ServerAction->>Prisma: Commit Local Order Transaction

        ServerAction->>ForeverPOS: Sync Order to ERP (ForeverPOS)
        alt ForeverPOS Sync Fails / Internal Error
            ForeverPOS-->>ServerAction: Error 500 / Network Timeout
            ServerAction->>AuthNet: Compensating Void: voidTransactionRequest(transId)
            AuthNet-->>ServerAction: Void Acknowledged
            ServerAction->>Prisma: Update Order status='voided_unrecoverable'
            ServerAction-->>Client: Checkout Rollback Error
        else ForeverPOS Sync Succeeds
            ForeverPOS-->>ServerAction: 200 OK (voucherId generated)
            ServerAction->>AuthNet: Phase 2: prioritizeCaptureRequest (PRIOR_AUTH_CAPTURE)
            AuthNet-->>ServerAction: Capture Settled
            ServerAction->>Prisma: Update Order status='completed'
            ServerAction-->>Client: 200 OK (Redirect to /order/confirmed)
        end
    end
